{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_152_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_152_1000_p", "source_sha256": "903bc6265ca8ee68ffac6c2a7e8b28ece3b4703666fd364be1355d1d07143561", "ja": "（次の定期公演が決まった。\n今回のセンターはジュリアだ）", "zh": "（下一场定期公演已经定下来了。这次的C位是茱莉亚。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_152_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_152_1001_p", "source_sha256": "f74cd6b079f3c86b8d39353ac1d21ae0e566266ae44ce8f18a3ebef95f7b7cc1", "ja": "（最近、ラジオ出演やロック雑誌の取材で話題に\nなってるからな……タイミングは、申し分ないはずだ）", "zh": "（最近因为参加广播节目和接受摇滚杂志采访而成了话题人物……时机应该再合适不过了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_152_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_152_1002_se", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_152_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_152_1003_019min", "source_sha256": "c4748fcfa859cff67e32ac81c9db1854728fe759619a9d8eb181e736877826f2", "ja": "お待たせしました！\nみんな、お疲れさまで～す♪", "zh": "让大家久等了！\n各位，辛苦啦～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_152_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_152_1004_001har", "source_sha256": "ab84ec871be928516e62bb2ee8cafac29337fd4cfe4e4654ec4544e6b5a5af31", "ja": "あっ、美奈子ちゃん、ロコちゃん。\n{$P$}さんも、お疲れさまです♪", "zh": "啊，美奈子、ROCO。\n{$P$}先生也辛苦了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_152_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_152_1006_p", "source_sha256": "292dc5f3802ac0d260f9845e909e6d14a7c300875c6f1d480bcc288dd2ab78e8", "ja": "お疲れさま。\n盛り上がってるな、何の話だ？", "zh": "辛苦了。\n气氛很热烈啊，在聊什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_152_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_152_1007_016tsu", "source_sha256": "396b45c230e72e22094c4ff722b104314f7a0d7fe1e7ab6a2068c3d18ca339fb", "ja": "最近、ロックの人たちにジュリアーノが\n人気あるんですよね？　その話ししてたんです！", "zh": "最近，摇滚圈的人里茱莉亚挺受欢迎的对吧？我们就在聊这个呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_152_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_152_1008_p", "source_sha256": "641ab5726dccd4109a5cded456b97f95d89770fc655e4d45b119c1dfb8bb81fd", "ja": "ああ、その事か。\n実際、仕事の依頼も増えてるよ。", "zh": "啊，是那件事啊。\n实际上，工作邀约也变多了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_152_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_152_1009_025roc", "source_sha256": "089e69f8ef22bb1c1f4d8fb5039d1016b2363b13597c33c4f121908638bda4c8", "ja": "何か、きっかけがあったんですか？", "zh": "是发生了什么契机吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_152_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_152_1010_p", "source_sha256": "f434be0cfcafa1653b4490d58176a285fdbafb142f6762f2fc244bb994a33301", "ja": "きっかけは、有名バンドの『Hi』が、SNSに\nジュリアの曲の弾き語りをアップした事かな？", "zh": "契机嘛，应该是知名乐队《Hi》在社交平台上传了茱莉亚的弹唱视频吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_152_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_152_1011_p", "source_sha256": "162d27403e538cd97abe05c1e5a6c42c1919312b0ed771cc0354da30b205e11a", "ja": "それを見た『Hi』ファンの人達が、\n原曲のジュリアのMVを見てくれたみたいで。", "zh": "听说看到那个的《Hi》粉丝们，也去看了原曲茱莉亚的MV。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_152_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_152_1012_019min", "source_sha256": "ed6487cae2cae805bf500910f1afee338f32c331dd65fbe6b2d4ed63dd5dcf6a", "ja": "へーっ。じゃあジュリアちゃんが\nラジオに呼ばれたのも、そのご縁で？", "zh": "诶——？那茱莉亚被邀请去电台，也是因为这段缘分吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_152_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_152_1013_050jul", "source_sha256": "4ec5e8b37a45bae1d1140cdc5c1c28e4ef893f4dce979f28b2e0d90aa0a2661d", "ja": "ああ。深夜番組だから、あたしの出演部分は生放送じゃ\nなかったけど。収録でもいいからって言われて……。", "zh": "嗯。因为是深夜节目，所以我出演的部分不是直播。不过他们说录制也可以，于是就……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_152_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_152_1014_p", "source_sha256": "b44ac5e8311b6163d7df93e2d84d43221bcb4369e335ad953a335fc5a33a7048", "ja": "色々配慮してくれて、ありがたい事だな。", "zh": "你方方面面都替我考虑到了，真是太感谢了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_152_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_152_1015_p", "source_sha256": "42d7c47f8b2295e659f65bf9b82998bb4ae89180a37de1ed35789337b57989ce", "ja": "ラジオにゲスト出演した事で、\nジュリアの知名度も益々上がったし……。", "zh": "因为作为嘉宾参加了广播节目，茱莉亚的知名度也越来越高了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_152_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_152_1017_025roc", "source_sha256": "6276b3a1f6402d9db5c569a0da15c74f2f67b9829078fd2646c55b710200f2ca", "ja": "昨夜は、ラジオをリアタイするのに夜ふかし\nしましたからね！　ロコも寝不足です……あふ。", "zh": "昨晚为了实时收听广播熬夜了嘛！ROCO也睡眠不足……呵欠。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_152_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_152_1018_p", "source_sha256": "a9721f1049980e03573858f507ef27e4e2437a86d0b8e90db1ca6766e79d16ee", "ja": "はは、みんな寝不足か？　眠いところ悪いけど、\n定期公演のミーティングはさせてもらうぞ。", "zh": "哈哈，大家都睡眠不足吗？虽然你们都很困，但还是得开个定期公演的会议。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_152_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_152_1019_p", "source_sha256": "38e7d454599af458aa92367e6a50f0ac66cfb95ad014378188a7810d9ccaa879", "ja": "今回の公演は、ジュリアがセンターだ。\n注目されている今、いいタイミングになったな。", "zh": "这次公演由茱莉亚担任中心。\n正受到关注，现在正是个好时机。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_152_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_152_1020_050jul", "source_sha256": "7a10dd8a9713830743ab85df0fae85d810ad8b4a4301fbdba69c499ce282abe6", "ja": "ん……。\nまぁ、そうなるのかな……。", "zh": "嗯……\n嘛，也是这么回事吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_152_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_152_1021_p", "source_sha256": "cb10131db803c127a7ec470c9eb9c699c8cf460db55de09f4d43257a09a63647", "ja": "それと新曲だけど、どうする？　もし外部の人に\n依頼をするなら、発注を考えないと……。", "zh": "另外，关于新歌，打算怎么办？如果要委托外面的人来创作，就得考虑下单的事了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_152_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_152_1022_016tsu", "source_sha256": "54bd5232f4b0ca63ef291c81af158a361892723b4db6efb4ac9f523964178601", "ja": "そんなの、聞くまでもありませんよ～。\nね、ジュリアーノ♪", "zh": "这还用得着问嘛～。对吧，茱莉亚诺♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_152_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_152_1023_025roc", "source_sha256": "7b7a48c9f07cd2c4a09afe712cdd670afa7cd7a4600501b7b68456c886ba4c9a", "ja": "ジュリアの、ロック・アーティストとしての才能、\n幅の広さを見せるチャンスですよ！", "zh": "这是展现茱莉亚作为摇滚音乐人的才华与多面性的机会哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_152_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_152_1024_019min", "source_sha256": "c819c9f7810bf5aa08350844d6d0bcc66da9f2dac1d0f09c56a8272ebd8560ff", "ja": "ジュリアちゃんの曲、よくかかってるもんね。この前、\nうちのお店のお客さんも好きだって言ってたよ。", "zh": "茱莉亚的歌经常播放呢。前几天，店里的客人也说喜欢来着。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_152_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_152_1025_050jul", "source_sha256": "7d22a8584dfc17350437515feb39740c72dc525daa3b45c7abc7cb2ac86f878c", "ja": "うーん……そうだな。\nできれば、作りたいとは思ってるんだけど……。", "zh": "嗯……是啊。\n可以的话，我确实想创作……可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_152_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_152_1026_050jul", "source_sha256": "5e036529da3f4d955267a19c1b1cd0ed6291d8aa0128a1400d7a70a20af1d146", "ja": "{$P$}。\nもうすこし、考える時間をもらってもいいか？", "zh": "{$P$}。\n能再给我一点时间考虑吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_152_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_152_1027_p", "source_sha256": "4be87ea08b0b186fc71da63c9d68d85ff83358d315545bffc0e1144b803b7623", "ja": "もちろん。まだ少し時間はあるから、\nどうしたいのか考えてみてくれ。", "zh": "当然。时间还剩一点，你先想想自己想怎么做吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_152_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_152_1028_050jul", "source_sha256": "e26a9015eda1acfc78fdbbbdd48d437aac4b8f8fe08c60d765d2fbfd206852a9", "ja": "わかった。", "zh": "我明白了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_152_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_152_1029_p", "source_sha256": "4262370f60bfb340db4232363cedc149e93665a1b7ffa63ff503557cc0cff47e", "ja": "それじゃ、今日のミーティングはここまで！\nレッスンは来週から、スケジュールはまた送るな。", "zh": "那么，今天的会议就到这里！\n课程从下周开始，日程安排我之后再发给你们。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_152_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_152_1030_p", "source_sha256": "9475863696ae78ea8d2f94eed452dc678fe3bbf7d3427a904ba3b8658ba06b84", "ja": "おっと、もうこんな時間か。\n俺は出るけど、後はよろしくな。", "zh": "哎呀，已经这么晚了啊。  \n我先走了，剩下的就拜托你了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_152_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_152_1031_null", "source_sha256": "26c542cc506cdc5b8c0d8634cfaa98ec1472de9e5308d0076f177ee279ec1016", "ja": "ガチャ、バタバタバタ……", "zh": "咔嗒、啪嗒啪嗒啪嗒……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_152_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_152_1032_050jul", "source_sha256": "d3bcd07b2b17b2296e549dfa36a20b68a448a383abd68bd2c864e478c3442200", "ja": "はぁ……。", "zh": "喔……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_152_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_152_1037_null", "source_sha256": "da059d21a570b44bc2ec4d818b19562b6534d21864a3a8f8c448cab94096da13", "ja": "1週間前、ラジオ放送局……", "zh": "1周前，广播电台……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_152_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_152_1038_vocal", "source_sha256": "472072b9725f9f56bbf99815e0f7bab6686975f57ca5b04451ee4a0d620382ed", "ja": "『Hiのミッドナイト・ロック』、前半に\n続いて後半も、ゲストはジュリアさんで～す！", "zh": "『Hi的午夜摇滚』，继前半段\n之后，后半段的嘉宾也是茱莉亚小姐～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_152_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_152_1039_050jul", "source_sha256": "033f7be18e9b9ff324ace80a37fa8967638f1712dc09a7bd36147111ac821d43", "ja": "よろしくお願いします！", "zh": "请多多指教！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_152_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_152_1040_vocal", "source_sha256": "11ffa237a58ad77d5b453b85700d01ebe83bc4f56b8d96fd85291ff1f818c88f", "ja": "それじゃ早速だけど、質問ね！　ジュリアさんて、\nもうロックをやる気はないの？　バンドで！", "zh": "那么马上进入正题，问你个问题！茱莉亚先生，\n已经不打算组乐队玩摇滚了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_152_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_152_1041_050jul", "source_sha256": "02aa7afd48d8c13f89d10052e4966a18841d07797b767919b27eef5a602eaec1", "ja": "えっ！？　えっと……\nそれは、まぁ……。", "zh": "诶！？呃……\n这个嘛……也就是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_152_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_152_1042_050jul", "source_sha256": "c64b5d93d66bf71281d09e1f7f7937fb42a09a191b9f0f5d7d1353f8d414d6ea", "ja": "今は、特に考えてない、ですね……。\nやりたい音楽は、765プロでもできるので。", "zh": "现在还没特别考虑过呢……  \n想做的音乐，在765事务所也能做。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_152_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_152_1043_guitarist", "source_sha256": "9bb2e48f67f20fccdafc239b51c74253bc28af2860584b7fca986b4c4371ce74", "ja": "そうなんだ！　いいな～。\n事務所が自由にさせてくれるんだね。", "zh": "原来是这样！真好啊～。\n事务所愿意让你自由发挥呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_152_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_152_1044_bassist", "source_sha256": "41c0f0b26c318abc29ae93139b57dc27919fca5c8bf3d8f26696193971b277d6", "ja": "俺達、前の事務所で全然好きにやれなかったもんな。\nタイアップでもダメとか言われて。", "zh": "我们在之前的事务所，根本没法随心所欲地做自己想做的事啊。\n就连合作也被说不行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_152_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_152_1045_050jul", "source_sha256": "6955385b9fc86cc033f8139bec7a53fef8873cb908acd97642ff6cddaced0eb9", "ja": "そうなんですか？", "zh": "是这样吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_152_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_152_1046_drummer", "source_sha256": "d2d1fc8b3d52ad937d773f2d17e60298ce8492f8f0fd815a965fd02591dbd5b2", "ja": "最近全員で大喜びしたの、アレだよな。俺達が\n小学生の時から大好きなアニメの、エンディング曲！", "zh": "最近大家一起欢呼雀跃的，就是那个吧。我们从小学起就超喜欢的那部动漫的片尾曲！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_152_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_152_1047_bassist", "source_sha256": "2fc5d03a0998a77c48323daeb2c780f0f039c6442627f47ec3e4c9694b80bb2d", "ja": "前にも声掛けてもらったんだけど、事務所に\n「バンドのイメージが」とか言われてNGで。", "zh": "之前也有人来邀请过我，不过事务所说什么“乐队形象”之类的，就没同意。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_152_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_152_1048_050jul", "source_sha256": "ff0c17a6c1ccf25d2e94855356db31fa7cff3cb90dc8b93b9ce1eb2da6c6616f", "ja": "え、マジで？\nやっぱ、そういうのあるんだ？", "zh": "诶，真的吗？\n果然还是有这种情况啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_152_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_152_1049_vocal", "source_sha256": "ccca0ca8343f39f9f58a542e781dfd9a05c48d93ee64e13f860480d8ed8bf4f1", "ja": "あるある！　でも独立したおかげで、今は765プロの\n曲とか、ジュリアちゃんのソロも歌えるけどね。", "zh": "确实有！不过多亏独立了，现在不仅能唱765事务所的\n歌，也能唱茱莉亚的独唱曲了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_152_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_152_1050_drummer", "source_sha256": "1ca4b1622e4ddd2dc5951bbdbd3bfe591f0195e3ef749be23682c3c7e9b5f6ad", "ja": "好きな曲を好きにやれるって、いいよな。\n俺達、結局はただの音楽好きだからさ。", "zh": "能随心所欲地演奏喜欢的歌曲，真好啊。\n毕竟我们说到头，也只是一帮热爱音乐的人罢了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_152_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_152_1051_guitarist", "source_sha256": "231b1c309573089cdb298714cfca46f60670e75aabaa4a87e2f53f841cbc7606", "ja": "ほんと、765プロの方がよっぽどロックだよ！", "zh": "说真的，765制作人才更摇滚啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_152_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_152_1053_null", "source_sha256": "4f10f377623d30a2f8e6eef9924c2cd8b7962dcbd80ad5f1e46aca35a570d7f4", "ja": "収録後……", "zh": "录音结束后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_152_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_152_1054_050jul", "source_sha256": "761206a06199539053b03c115e570375ebd6450eb447806d00a4e3fccd3518bb", "ja": "ふぅ、やっと終わった。ラジオのゲストなのに、\n撮影があるから衣装に着替えなきゃいけないとか……。", "zh": "呼，终于结束了。明明只是来当电台嘉宾，却因为还有拍摄，必须换上演出服……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_152_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_152_1055_050jul", "source_sha256": "86b69ae8d6433f4c124375509358e23bbf491caa8c815c638b32f1a19f32b728", "ja": "ロックバンドも、アイドル並に大変なんだな。\nいやまぁ、着替えがあるのはあたしもなんだけど……。", "zh": "摇滚乐队也和偶像一样辛苦啊。\n不过嘛，要换衣服的也不只是我……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_152_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_152_1058_050jul", "source_sha256": "730429e7bf2fe109b8ea727b3460fd7fb01918a8e43a065b7e04b71416e887d8", "ja": "？　あれは……{$P$}？\n一緒にいるのは、『Hi』のマネージャーさん……？", "zh": "？那是……{$P$}？和他一起的是“Hi”的经纪人……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_152_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_152_1059_manager", "source_sha256": "4ab1b8364ae0d2ecc1ba5c3b6379949aa5692668d1ef12c7af1636229f0367a9", "ja": "実は今度、うちでロックのレーベルを新設するんです。\nジュリアさんにも、是非参加していただきたくて……。", "zh": "其实我们这边接下来要新设一个摇滚厂牌。\n非常希望茱莉亚也能来参加……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_152_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_152_1060_p", "source_sha256": "184e4b701d8ae0b3b46c87d7b43da79e4168b56c491c07d4b68f9ece4297ecbf", "ja": "ありがとうございます！　いいお話だと思います。\n前向きに検討させていただきますね。", "zh": "非常感谢！我觉得这是个很好的提议。\n我们会积极考虑的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_152_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_152_1061_050jul", "source_sha256": "63b0a53cd81edf40031293fd128ba9d36729c27e83d913a1c83bcbf1dcfcab8a", "ja": "えっ……。", "zh": "咦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_152_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_152_1062_050jul", "source_sha256": "dbe1f8f6b95f6799a82eab4fc0071350ba9cc62c9777a40fcd0c374bcefcaefa", "ja": "（ロックのレーベルを新設？　レーベルって……\nもしかして、あたしに移籍しろってことか？）", "zh": "（要新设摇滚厂牌？厂牌……难道是想让我转到那边去吗？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
